    compilation and installation of an Executable.

1.9. "Executable" means Covered Code in any form other than Source Code.

1.10. "You" (or "Your") means an individual or a legal entity
    exercising rights under, and complying with all of the terms of,
    this License or a future version of this License. For legal
    entities, "You" includes any entity which controls, is controlled
    by, or is under common control with You. For purposes of this
    definition, "control" means (a) the power, direct or indirect, to
    cause the direction or management of such entity, whether by
    contract or otherwise, or (b) ownership of more than fifty percent
